        <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2"><a href="/zh" class="hover:underline">首页</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/zh/tutorials" class="hover:underline">教程</a> &rsaquo; <span class="text-gray-700">{zhTitle}</span></nav>
        <div set:html={enBody} />
      </div>
      <aside class="space-y-6 mt-8 lg:mt-0"><div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">速查</h3><ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1"><li><strong>GA 日期：</strong> 2026-08-20</li><li><strong>Computer use 开销：</strong> ~4,500 输入 token</li><li><strong>四个组件：</strong> Computer use / Browser use / Skills API / Files API</li><li><strong>Skills API 端点：</strong> POST/GET/DELETE /v1/skills[/{id}[/versions]]</li><li><strong>Files API：</strong> 5x 速率、每组织 1 TB 存储</li><li><strong>HIPAA：</strong> Computer use 在 BAA 范围内</li><li><strong>Sonnet 5 基础：</strong> $2 入 / $10 出 每百万</li><li><strong>Opus 5 基础：</strong> $5 入 / $25 出 每百万</li><li><strong>Haiku 4.5 基础：</strong> $1 入 / $5 出 每百万</li><li><strong>Fable 5 基础：</strong> $10 入 / $50 出 每百万</li></ul></div><div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">{affiliateSidebar.title}</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">{affiliateSidebar.description}</p><a href={affiliateSidebar.url} class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-blue-700">{affiliateSidebar.cta}</a></div></aside>
